<title>USA: Continental Airlines completes notes issue.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines completes notes issue.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said it has closed its previously announced offering of $250 million of 9-1/2 percent senior notes due December 15, 2001.</p>
<p>The net proceeds will be used by the airline for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
